{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40724","headline":"赠可上人 · 李洞","name":"赠可上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺门和鹤倚香杉，月吐秋光到思嚵。\n将法传来穿泱漭，把诗吟去入嵌岩。\n馍糊书卷烟岚滴，狼籍衣裳瀑布缄。\n不断清风牙底嚼，无因内殿得名衔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}